    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυσ-τόν</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύω,</span> lit. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shaved,</i> sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρυ</span>) <i>shaft, pole,</i> e.g. spear-<i>shaft,</i>
			
